            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Vulnerable to Endure Elements"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "An ice golem can be targeted with endure elements even if it's not willing. If it is targeted, for 1 round it can't use Breath Weapon or benefit from creeping cold, and its fist attack doesn't deal cold damage."
